Pioneer of online flash sales since 2001 and key player in European e-commerce, Veepee collaborates with over 7,000 brands to offer highly discounted products available for a limited time. Operating across various sectors, including fashion, home, wine, travel or beauty... Veepee achieved a turnover of 3.3 billion euros incl. VAT in 2024 and employs 5,000 staff members across 10 countries.

📄 JOB DESCRIPTION
Explain and guide the sellers through their onboarding process to our internal platforms on the German Brandsplace and resolve and assist them through technical problems
🎯 TASKS
• Reporting to the Lead Brand Support North, the responsibilities and duties are:
• Activity 1 : Explain and guide the seller through their onboarding process to our internal platforms / BO: integration of the catalog in our tools, trainings on back offices etc.;
• Activity 2 : Find solutions adapted to the seller’s profile on a technical point of view;
• Activity 3 : Follow up and communicate on the progression of the onboarding with the Veepee sales team;
• Activity 4 : Resolve and assist sellers through technical problems;
• Activity 5 : Help and assist the seller with regards to the technical part in order to add new products to our permanent offer / catalogs;
• Activity 6 : Help and assist the seller with regards to the technical part during the preparation of connected flash and campaigns;
• Activity 7 : Closely follow the updates from our technical partners;
• Activity 8 : Write and update documentations shareable internally and with the sellers and improve proactively our processes.
👉 MUST HAVE skills
• Experience on technical support;
• Able to identify and analyse technical issues;
• Experience on marketplace;
• Good communication, logic and organisation skills;
• Rigorous and proactive profile;
• Able to identify and analyse technical issues;
• English and fluent in German.
👉 NICE TO HAVE skills
• Based in Barcelona
✅ BENEFITS
• 👉Variable bonus
• 👉Hybrid work model with the possibility to smartworking 2 days a week
• 👉Online language learning Platform
• 👉Intensive workday on Friday
• 👉Health Insurance
• 👉Holidays: 27 days
⚙️RECRUITMENT PROCESS
• 1️⃣HR interview
• 2️⃣Hiring Manager Interview
